# Editor/agent scratch state — never project code.
.freebuff/

# Author-time only: Kokoro TTS bundle + ONNX model (~125 MB). Used to generate
# the pre-rendered MP3s in decks/<id>/narration/; never shipped, never committed.
# It embeds an Emscripten build of eSpeak-NG (GPL-3.0-or-later) inside an
# otherwise Apache-2.0 package, which is why it lives OUTSIDE assets/ — see
# tools/kokoro-authoring/README.md and doc/LIBRARY_RESEARCH.md §2.
tools/kokoro-authoring/cache/
tools/kokoro-authoring/kokoro/

# Author-time narration tooling (tools/narration). The npm dependency and
# the incremental render state are per-machine, never committed: the state
# keys clips by content so only changed cards ever re-synthesise.
tools/narration/node_modules/
tools/narration/.cache/
